  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0-preview.2: Add BuildAnthropicParams helper that builds MessageCreateParams with cache_control markers on system prompt, conversation prefix, and tool manifest, so SDK-direct callers get the same prompt-caching behaviour as the AssistStudio Claude provider (smoke verified ~67% prefix-token savings on 3-turn PDF conversations). Rebuild against AssistStudio.Anthropic 0.1.0-preview.2 (Anthropic SDK 12.16.0), Controls.WinUI 0.18.0 (Mermaid/SVG, diagram action header, compose-bar reuse), Ai.Providers 0.6.0, and AssistStudio.Core 0.18.0 (.Core namespace segment).",
